				<guid>/posts/cova-de-cornavaques/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;details&#34;&gt;Details&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;identification&#34;&gt;Identification&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feature type:&lt;/strong&gt; Cave&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Source:&lt;/strong&gt; Mapcarta.com&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;cave-and-exploration-data&#34;&gt;Cave and exploration data&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tourism potential:&lt;/strong&gt; Medium&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;additional-notes&#34;&gt;Additional Notes&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;mondaventura.com:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://mondaventura.com/activities-adventure-mallorca-pollensa/trips-guided-tours/caving-speleology/land-cave-cornavaques/&#34;&gt;https://mondaventura.com/activities-adventure-mallorca-pollensa/trips-guided-tours/caving-speleology/land-cave-cornavaques/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Cornavaques cave is located in the Range of Sant Vicenç, next to the Range of Cornavaques.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It’s one of the most spectacular caves of Mallorca, an unimaginable paradise, a myriad of fascinating and huge formations (some of them unique in the island!) within an authentic natural museum. Ceilings and walls leave us baffled, you’ve never seen anything like this!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
