			<item>
				<title>Cova de sa Piqueta</title>
				<link>/posts/cova-de-sa-piqueta/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>/posts/cova-de-sa-piqueta/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;details&#34;&gt;Details&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;identification&#34;&gt;Identification&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feature type:&lt;/strong&gt; Cave&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System name:&lt;/strong&gt; Pirata-Pont-Piqueta&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Source:&lt;/strong&gt; MapCarta&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;cave-and-exploration-data&#34;&gt;Cave and exploration data&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cave rating:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exploration potential:&lt;/strong&gt; High&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Goes to water:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;additional-notes&#34;&gt;Additional Notes&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Cova de sa Piqueta is a cave in Balearic Islands. Cova de sa Piqueta is situated nearby to the caves Cova des Pont and &lt;a href=&#34;/posts/clot-de-sa-clova-redona/&#34;&gt;Clot de sa Clova Redona&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BBC:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.bbc.com/news/magazine-40558067&#34;&gt;https://www.bbc.com/news/magazine-40558067&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DeeperBlue:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.deeperblue.com/cave-diver-rescued-spending-two-days-trapped-cave/&#34;&gt;https://www.deeperblue.com/cave-diver-rescued-spending-two-days-trapped-cave/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Cave divers Xisco Gràcia and Guillem Mascaró had to make the most difficult of decisions on April 15, 2017. Trapped in an air pocket deep in a cave, they only had enough gas between them for one of them to make it out, and the other would have to stay behind, according to the BBC.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
